  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One chain, one closure",
      "items": [
        "Every phase ends with a review; spec, plan, wave and branch reviews share the Review Convergence rule",
        "blocker findings route to fix and a re-review; warn/nit-only closes as REVIEW_FIX; zero findings closes",
        "cdd-close lands the closeout backfill first, then asks the developer how to finish"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Three spec targets",
      "items": [
        "single-spec — a program that fits one spec; docs/kairos/specs",
        "phase-spec — one registered phase; docs/kairos/specs, carries program: (the parent overall's slug)",
        "overall — a multi-phase program charter; docs/kairos/overalls, then hands off to the next phase's design",
        "The design flow sizes the scope: single-spec / fit → cdd-spec-writer; multi / oversized → the overall charter"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Backfill & annotate — the return flows",
      "items": [
        "Backfill lands a durable fact in its owning doc (overall · spec · plan), never in chat",
        "Mid-flight: land immediately → commit on its own → pause the loop until clean → the next review audits it in-band",
        "cdd-plan backfills the spec when planning surfaces drift; cdd-close backfills the closeout before the finish menu",
        "Annotate: a finding needing a ruling gets the ruling written into the findings carrier; fix consumes the annotated carrier"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The next: contract",
      "items": [
        "The engine's next: line is the only continuation — the orchestrator follows it instead of re-deciding",
        "implement → review → fix → next-wave | done; the branch review is the final gate",
        "A BLOCKED or TIMEOUT round prints CDD_BLOCKED and carries no next: line"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Gates before dispatch",
      "items": [
        "Pre-flight order: tree-clean → plan graph → wave gate → doc contract",
        "A dirty tree BLOCKS before any child runs; an uncommitted backfill trips the same gate",
        "All prompts, findings and ledgers are files under .kairos/cdd, never chat state"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "What ships",
      "items": [
        "Task commits accumulate on the feature branch; the branch review judges the whole diff",
        "cdd-close offers merge / PR / keep / discard; every change carries a changeset",
        "Develop is the integration branch; production releases flow develop → main → npm"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
